rrantes para hallar qué comer: y si no se sacian, murmuren.", "words": [[0, 109411], [6, 109913], [12, 110403], [21, 110893], [26, 111113], [33, 111453], [37, 111593], [44, 112392], [46, 112515], [49, 112655], [52, 112835], [55, 113015], [63, 114146]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 115628, "end": 125531, "text": "Pero yo cantaré tu fortaleza, y alabaré de mañana tu misericordia: porque has sido mi amparo y refugio en el día de mi angustia.", "words": [[0, 115628], [5, 115792], [8, 116132], [16, 116757], [19, 116937], [30, 117917], [32, 118397], [40, 118877], [43, 118997], [50, 119377], [53, 119637], [67, 121021], [74, 121206], [78, 121426], [83, 121786], [86, 122106], [93, 122746], [95, 122846], [103, 123726], [106, 123966], [109, 124126], [113, 124366], [116, 124526], [119, 124666]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 125881, "end": 132451, "text": "Fortaleza mía, a ti cantaré; porque eres Dios de mi amparo, Dios de mi misericordia.", "words": [[0, 125881], [10, 126545], [15, 126965], [17, 127225], [20, 127345], [29, 128380], [36, 128624], [41, 128844], [46, 129144], [49, 129364], [52, 129504], [60, 130484], [65, 130864], [68, 131064], [71, 131184]]}]}